In a similar way, by (A4),
\begin{align*}
\lefteqn{\Eb\big[ {L_\psi}(X^k)^2\|\varPsi(X^k,\theta^k)\|^2\big| \Fc_k\big]}\\
&\le 2 \Eb\big[{L_\psi}(X^k)^2\big( \|\varPsi(X^k,\theta^0)\|^2 + {L_\psi}(X^k)^2 \|\theta^k-\theta^0\|^2\big)\big| \Fc_k\big]
