The first coordinate of the differential inclusion \eqref{diff-inc-beta} reads:
\begin{equation}
\dt{\beta} \in \varPi_{\Tc_{\Bb}(\beta)}\big(-\Eb[F_\beta \nabla g(\varPsi) ] \big) = \varPi_{\Tc_{\Bb}(\beta)}\big( -G_\beta + \Delta^{0}_\beta \big),
